ee:message.ee:set-payload:
%dw 2.0
output application/json
fun transformOperation(operation) = operation match { case "SUP"->"S" case "CRE"->"X" else -> operation }
--- payload map (item,index)-> { matricule: item.CODSEL, codeCentre: "", typeOcupation:"RG1", natureOccupation: "RG2", dateDebut: "RG3", dateFin:"RG4", operation: transformOperation(item.LIG)
}
